From 30f8bc286930d0e7c85824215441245a978fad88 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 06:19:15 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] lane-194: q4_0 -> F16 Vulkan cpy shader + F16 KV tail compose
 (OPT-IN, default OFF)

The missing shader lane-192 SS3.5 and lane-193 named as the bottleneck behind three
banked wins. quant->F32 was the only Vulkan cpy read-back that existed, so the KV
precision tail's compose had to materialise the FULL WINDOW as F32 - the tail's
-20.3% decode price and its 1014.5 MiB of scratch at 131K.

The shader itself needed no new math: copy_from_quant.comp already carries the
dequant, and D_TYPE is a define. Emitting it once more with D_TYPE=float16_t is the
whole kernel. The D_TYPE() wraps are a no-op for the existing float variants and
required because GLSL forbids the implicit float->float16_t narrowing.

NOT A PRECISION TRADE, and this is the load-bearing claim: the ring is ALREADY F16
(llama-kv-cache.cpp:514). The F32 compose UPCAST it, purely so ggml_concat could
match the F32 body leg. Composing in F16 deletes that upcast. On the body leg, q4_0
dequantises to d*(q-8) with d an F16 scale, which F16 carries to ~2^-11 relative -
three orders below q4_0's own ~2^-4 grid.

Scope: q4_0 only. One type, one pipeline, one test key. Emitting the other twelve
for symmetry would add pipelines and supports_op rows nothing dispatches - the
unbacked-surface shape that cost lane-148 and lane-150 a silent 0-executed green.

- FIFTH ARIFI-SYNC-SET pair (cpy.quant_to_f16), both members {Q4_0}; expected counts
  bumped 16->18 regions / 4->5 sets. Checker green, and it CAUGHT my own first draft
  (a marker whose name absorbed trailing prose) before the build.
- F16 compose gated LLAMA_KV_TAIL_F16, default OFF = shipped F32 path byte-identical
  (F-145 one binary, two arms). Refused unless body is q4_0, checked at the source
  rather than trusted from the env var: F16 over a q5_0/q8_0 body would make
  supports_op decline the cast and push the whole compose onto the CPU.
- All FOUR cast sites flip through one ct, including the noring control, so that arm
  stays a one-variable control under F16.
- NEGATIVE CONTROL (F-116): a wrong-scale variant built into the same binary and
  swapped into the SAME pipeline slot under GGML_VK_ARIFI_NEG_CPY_F16=1.
- Three keyed CPY q4_0->F16 cases incl. a non-contiguous permuted source. F-112: to
  be asserted EXECUTED, not merely green.

Build: canonical configure (-D_WIN32_WINNT=0x0A00, LLAMA_CURL=OFF), exit 0.

Report board/programs/local-inference/lanes/2026-09-01-lane-194-q4f16-shader-REPORT.md

Conflict-resolved: S4 split (f172be756): auto_split - our hunks re-homed into ggml-vulkan-types.h; wrap/same-point regions merged in place (fixS4_492.py)
